  <name>ClipPress</name>
  <summary>Fast desktop video clipping</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Fast open-source clip editor for turning long recordings into clean, shareable clips. Open media, mark the in and out points, optionally adjust clip details, then export a shareable result. ClipPress is built on top of LosslessCut and uses ffmpeg for media processing.</p>
  </description>
